0,Talinga language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talinga_language,"Talinga or Bwisi is a Bantu language spoken in the Uganda–Congo border region. It is called Talinga (Kitalinga) in DRC and Bwisi (Lubwisi, Olubwisi) in Uganda.",Talinga-Bwisi,Niger-Congo
